WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.840
The Saint Bernard stayed at the centre of the series as the films changed households, casts and settings.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:11.680
1992. Beethoven introduces George and Alice Newton.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:16.080
2000. The third film follows another Newton household.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.280
2008. Beethoven’s Big Break sets the story around filmmaking.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:27.560
The full release order includes the second film, later sequels and the cast changes between them.
